Elements

Wooden pieces, 150 mm x 50 mm x 30 mm, painted in the team colors on 2 of these larger opposite sides, the other Giant Jenga piece, rounded edges Hazelnut box side stay clean, with a vinyl on which may vary. are the tags aruco 36 and 47. Their weight is not defined and depends on the organisation.

Wooden pieces, 150 mm x 50 mm x 30 mm, painted in black, with a vinyl Giant Jenga piece, rounded edges Empty crate on which are the tags aruco 41. Their may vary. weight is not defined and depends on the organisation.

The cursor

Ledge

Game floor by Planète Sciences

The material’s density can change from one country to another. It is highly recommended that the teams try different types of materials since the weight may differ significantly.
